        "Title": "The Mafia doesn&apos;t forget",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110980198191",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "A mafia from Italy has had quite a few problems with Amos Dexter. They won&apos;t say why but, it&apos;s not hard to guess if you just see how Dexter acts.\rRegardless, they want him dead. However, intel places Mr Dexter in a medical resot in Japan. They do not have the resources to send people here just for one hit. This is where we come in. They prefer Mr Dexter to be killed in public with an unsilenced weapon as a message. However, it&apos;s optional. They would also like two bullets in his head if possible.",
